---
import WorkspaceSectionLayout from "../../../layouts/WorkspaceSectionLayout.astro";
---

<WorkspaceSectionLayout
  eyebrow="Work-unit intake"
  title="Requests"
  description="A truthful placeholder for future durable work-request records."
>
  <h2>No persisted requests</h2>
  <p>
    The current vertical slice translates and routes one request in memory on the <a
      href="/workspace/">workspace home</a
    >. Refreshing the page clears that state.
  </p>
  <h3>What a future record will contain</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>the original request and normalized goal;</li>
    <li>assumptions, blocking questions, constraints, and acceptance criteria;</li>
    <li>retrieved Markdoc pages and accepted ADR constraints;</li>
    <li>risk, provider preference, approvals, and documentation impact.</li>
  </ul>
</WorkspaceSectionLayout>
